The '''Booster Cookie''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable that grants multiple benefits that last for {{Green|4}} days. Multiple cookies can be consumed at once to increase the duration.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Booster Cookie''' can be purchased from the [[Elizabeth|Community Shop]] for {{Gems|325}}.

{{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} will give every player one untradable '''Booster Cookie''' for free. This free booster cookie is available only once per account, not once per profile. 

An additional '''Booster Cookie''' can also be obtained from her after completing the security quest in the {{Zone|Security Hall}}, once per profile. These cookies cannot be sold on the [[Bazaar]], [[Auction House]] or to [[NPC|Merchants]]. They also cannot be stored in the player's [[Ender Chest]] or dropped on the ground, and can only be eaten by the player who obtained them.

'''Booster Cookie''' is the only item that can be bought from the [[Bazaar]] in all [[Profiles]].

== Effects ==
The '''Booster Cookie''' grants the player the following bonuses for 4 days:
*Ability to gain {{Bits}}! (See [[Booster Cookie#Bits Available|§Bits Available]] for more details)
*{{stat|wisdom|+25|icononly=yes}} on all [[Wisdom|{{DarkAqua|Wisdom}}]] stats
*{{stat|mf|+15}}
*Keep {{C}} on death
*{{Yellow|Permafly}} on private islands and gardens
*Quick access to some menus using their respective commands:
*:{{Gold|/ah}}, {{Gold|/bazaar}}, {{Green|/bank}}, {{Gold|/accessorybag}}, {{Light Purple|/timepocket}},
*:{{White|/anvil}}, {{Pink|/hex}}, {{Aqua|/etable}}, {{Pink|/potionbag}}, and {{Yellow|/quiver}} 
*Sell items directly to the trades and cookie menu
*AFK {{Green|immunity}} on your island and garden
*Toggle specific [[Potions|{{pink|potion effects}}]]
*Link your items in chat using {{Yellow|/show}}
*Insta-sell your Material stash to the [[Bazaar|{{Gold|Bazaar}}]]
*Increases [[Chocolate Factory|{{Gold|Chocolate Factory}}]] production by {{Gold|+0.25x}}
*Allows consuming {{Blue|Mixins}} directly from your inventory
*Call {{Dark Aqua|Abiphone Contacts}} with {{Aqua|/call}}

The Booster Cookie's duration counts down even when the player is offline. 

