== Bits Available ==
Booster Cookies allow players to generate {{bits}}, each Cookie has a limit to how many {{bits}} can be generated, which changes with [[Fame Ranks]] and [[Museum/Milestones|Museum Milestones]]. Bits are generated every half an hour by {{green|5.20833%}} (precisely {{green|1/19.2}}) of what one Cookie can provide, which can be increased by {{Item|Bits Talisman}}. Additionally, {{bits}} are awarded from defeating Bosses, finishing dungeons or participating in Events across Skyblock. (See [[Bits#Earning|Earning Bits]] for more details)
