*If the player was in a [[Co-op]] with player(s) who have not claimed the free cookie, they were able to get two or more free cookies by placing the free cookie(s) in a chest on their {{Zone|Private Island}}.
**This doesn't work anymore. The free Cookies are now tied to specific players. When another tries to consume it, the game sends this message: {{RawMctxt|&cThis cookie was given to another player! You may not consume it!}}
*A player can still obtain a '''Booster Cookie''' on [[Bingo]] through the Security Quest. However, because the player cannot spend Bits at {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} on this profile, the only way they can be spent is through tuning templates with {{NPCSprite|Maxwell}}, or refreshing [[Experiments|Experiments]].
